{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38524","headline":"寄杨侍郎 · 吴融","name":"寄杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云情鹤态莫夸慵，正上仙楼十二重。\n吟逸易沈鳷鹊月，梦长先断景阳钟。\n奇文已刻金书券，秘语看镌玉检封。\n何事春来待归隐，探知溪畔有风松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}